OHOS: make the first-run experience keyboard-first. The platform only allows
a normal app to register global mouse monitors while it is actively capturing
the screen with AVScreenCapture, so hide the global mouse settings page, its
navigation entry and its related link on OHOS instead of showing rows stuck in
the Failed state. Add screen-recording defaults (Ctrl+Alt+F2 / Ctrl+F2)
alongside the existing screenshot pair (Ctrl+Alt+F1 / Ctrl+F1).

